# ========================================================
# ⚡ CodeArena - Root Environment Examples & Configuration
# ========================================================
# CodeArena is structured as a full-stack monorepo:
#   - Frontend (React 19 + Vite):   located in ./frontend
#   - Backend (Node.js + Express):  located in ./backend
#
# To get started locally, copy the example files into their directories:
#   cd backend && cp .env.example .env
#   cd ../frontend && cp .env.example .env
#
# --------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Backend Environment Variables (backend/.env)
# --------------------------------------------------------
# PORT=8080
# NODE_ENV=development
#
# Database:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host/database?sslmode=require
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@<cluster>.mongodb.net/codearena
#
# JWT Authentication:
# JWT_SECRET=codearena-super-secure-jwt-dev-secret-key-2026
# JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRY_MS=3600000
# JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRY_MS=604800000
#
# Admin Passphrase (required to register new ADMIN accounts):
# ADMIN_SECRET_CODE=codearena-admin-2026
#
# CORS Origin:
# CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
#
# Sandboxed Code Execution:
# JUDGE_DISABLED=true
#
# --------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Frontend Environment Variables (frontend/.env)
# --------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/api
# ========================================================
